ir impact across the world.Experience Loud &amp;amp; Queer and the incewdible art and stories that come with it.  Tickets are pay what you can. There is a bar to buy drinks. Come and experience Trans RAGE first hand. \",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Chats Palace\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Chats Palace, 42-44 Brooksby&#39;s Walk\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E9 6DF\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.55023\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0428147\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/OutOfStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40845/identity-chats-palace-preview-exhibition-tickets-with-film-screening\",\"lowPrice\":0,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"validFrom\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00+00:00\"},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/rage-limited\", \"description\" : \"At R.A.G.E Limited ; we build platforms for under-represented communities by allowing them space to create art. With that art, we create exhibitions and events based around artistic education.We believe that art is the most effective tool for change and that is just what we are doing. Reshaping Society Through Art.\", \"name\" : \"R.A.G.E Limited\"}},{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ExhibitionEvent\",\"name\": \"IDENTITY! Chats Palace - Preview Exhibition tickets with Film Screening\",\"startDate\": \"2026-11-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-11-18T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40845/identity-chats-palace-preview-exhibition-tickets-with-film-screening\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/93882679-e2ca-4d2c-97e5-f2273476979d.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"COME AND SEE THE TRANS RAGE EXHIBITION. 4 VENUES. 40 DAYS. 70+ WORKS. Trans Rage Exhibition 2026IDENTITY.  Preview Event at Chats Palace, E9 6DF18 NOV  6PM-10PM The IDENTITY.  Exhibition is in collaboration with Loud &amp;amp; Queer.  About Loud &amp;amp; Queer:Loud &amp;amp; Queer is a vibrant online platform amplifying LGBTQ+ voices, celebrating queer creativity, and sharing powerful stories of LGBTQ+ individuals and their impact across the world.Experience Loud &amp;amp; Queer and the incewdible art and stories that come with it.  Tickets are pay what you can. There is a bar to buy drinks. Come and experience Trans RAGE first hand. \",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Chats Palace\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Chats Palace, 42-44 Brooksby&#39;s Walk\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E9 6DF\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.55023\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0428147\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-11-18T17:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40845/identity-chats-palace-preview-exhibition-tickets-with-film-screening\",\"lowPrice\":0,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-10-22T09:51:28+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-10-22T09:51:28+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-11-18T17:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Pay what you can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40845/identity-chats-palace-preview-exhibition-tickets-with-film-screening\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-10-22T09:51:28+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-10-22T09:51:28+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/rage-limited\", \"description\" : \"At R.A.G.E Limited ; we build platforms for under-represented communities by allowing them space to create art. With that art, we create exhibitions and events based around artistic education.We believe that art is the most effective tool for change and that is just what we are doing. Reshaping Society Through Art.\", \"name\" : \"R.A.G.E Limited\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 40845,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 5840,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\