 </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    The Festive Season!\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: The Mother\",\"startDate\": \"2026-11-18T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-11-18T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40992/transmissions-presents-the-mother\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/48a352eb-0d4b-4a89-9a32-aace3c06f7e7.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"From screenwriter Hanif Kureishi (My Beautiful Laundrette), Daniel Craig stars opposite Anne Reid in a scandalous British drama about a recent widow who falls into bed with her daughter&#39;s boyfriend in The Mother (2003).Named one of the best films of the year on release by none other than John Waters, The Mother (2003) is about the tug of desire that calls us to abandon sense and start living.Join us downstairs at Dalston Superstore for a rarely screened and deeply felt melodrama. Why shouldn&#39;t I be difficult?  Subtitles will be displayed throughout the film.Seating is a mixture of backed chairs, benches, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Dalston Superstore\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Dalston Superstore, 117 Kingsland High Street\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E8 2PB\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.5501\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0753984\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-11-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\