            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tGODDESS BUNNY Tickets | 20 Nov @ Chats Palace, London | £5 to £15 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7769677a7968bf74e504bc7599959c8f5cdfe69ca94b0638a17c981254064d3f3540f1cb22d8839bc7820c9608d113eb98efe7ea68fbf7cc1ac3c817446e0c56/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-11-02\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Goddess Bunny Superstar film screening Performance by Midgitte BardotHosted by Midgitte Bardot | Presented by Gushing | Live at Chats Palace This event is a tribute evening dedicated to Goddess Bunny. We will share a test screening of the unreleased film Goddess Bunny Superstar (2026), hosted by Midgitte Bardot and presented by Gushing, followed by a special live performance by Midgitte Bardot. This evening is inspired by Goddess Bunny and offers an opportunity to collectively reflect on her life and legacy. We will celebrate trans, intersex, queer and disabled identities and provide a relaxed moment for connection and gathering on the occasion of Trans Day of Remembrance at queer venue Chats Palace. Thank you to Chats Palace, Matthew Patrick and Hackney Council for the generous support as part of Hackney PRIDE365. SCHEDULE: 5.30pm : Doors open6.30pm: Theatre doors open (priority for people with access needs)7-7.45pm: Screening part of unreleased film Goddess Bunny Superstar (2026) (45 mins) 7.45-8.05pm: Break (20 mins)8.05-8.35pm: Live performance by Midgitte Bardot (30 mins)8.35-10.30pm: Reflection, socialising, drinks at the bar For a short introduction to Goddess Bunny, see ‘Goddess Bunny: The Forgotten story of a Hollywood Icon’ film by Dazed: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DMJeWH_sUVg ACCESS NEEDS:  If you have access needs and would like priority seating, please let our door person know on arrival so we can call you to take your place earlier. Film is not captioned.  TAXI FUND:  We have a modest access budget towards taxis for disabled people&#39;s travel to/from this event.  If you’d like to be considered for this please get in touch once you’ve booked a ticket for the event. As funds are limited they will be allocated on a first come first served basis. Please email gabby@gushing.co.uk if you’d like to be on this list and reimbursements will be made after the event, with proof of taxi receipt, up to the maximum budget we have available, and a maximum of &#163;15 per person. VENUE ACCESS: There is step-free access into the building and the ground floor, with double doors throughout. There is an accessible toilet. The event will have a mix of low level soft seating, cabaret tables, theatre style seating, tall stools with tall tables, and wheelchair access. For more information on venue accessibility: https://chatspalace.com/access/ venue@chatspalace.com 0203 866 7195  Photo credit:Left: Goddess Bunny by Chuck Grant via NYT. Right: Midgitte Bardot by Holly Revell.\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"GODDESS BUNNY Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40486/goddess-bunny\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/4edf6b68-bde4-4f17-b8d9-489bcbdcb31d.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"GODDESS BUNNY Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40486/goddess-bunny\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/4edf6b68-bde4-4f17-b8d9-489bcbdcb31d.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Goddess Bunny Superstar film screening Performance by Midgitte BardotHosted by Midgitte Bardot | Presented by Gushing | Live at Chats Palace This event is a tribute evening dedicated to Goddess Bunny. We will share a test screening of the unreleased film Goddess Bunny Superstar (2026), hosted by Midgitte Bardot and presented by Gushing, followed by a special live performance by Midgitte Bardot. This evening is inspired by Goddess Bunny and offers an opportunity to collectively reflect on her life and legacy. We will celebrate trans, intersex, queer and disabled identities and provide a relaxed moment for connection and gathering on the occasion of Trans Day of Remembrance at queer venue Chats Palace. Thank you to Chats Palace, Matthew Patrick and Hackney Council for the generous support as part of Hackney PRIDE365. SCHEDULE: 5.30pm : Doors open6.30pm: Theatre doors open (priority for people with access needs)7-7.45pm: Screening part of unreleased film Goddess Bunny Superstar (2026) (45 mins) 7.45-8.05pm: Break (20 mins)8.05-8.35pm: Live performance by Midgitte Bardot (30 mins)8.35-10.30pm: Reflection, socialising, drinks at the bar For a short introduction to Goddess Bunny, see ‘Goddess Bunny: The Forgotten story of a Hollywood Icon’ film by Dazed: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DMJeWH_sUVg ACCESS NEEDS:  If you have access needs and would like priority seating, please let our door person know on arrival so we can call you to take your place earlier. Film is not captioned.  TAXI FUND:  We have a modest access budget towards taxis for disabled people&#39;s travel to/from this event.  If you’d like to be considered for this please get in touch once you’ve booked a ticket for the event. As funds are limited they will be allocated on a first come first served basis. Please email gabby@gushing.co.uk if you’d like to be on this list and reimbursements will be made after the event, with proof of taxi receipt, up to the maximum budget we have available, and a maximum of &#163;15 per person. VENUE ACCESS: There is step-free access into the building and the ground floor, with double doors throughout. There is an accessible toilet. The event will have a mix of low level soft seating, cabaret tables, theatre style seating, tall stools with tall tables, and wheelchair access. For more information on venue accessibility: https://chatspalace.com/access/ venue@chatspalace.com 0203 866 7195  Photo credit:Left: Goddess Bunny by Chuck Grant via NYT. Right: Midgitte Bardot by Holly Revell.\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40486/goddess-bunny\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | GODDESS BUNNY | Friday 20th November 2026 @ Chats Palace | £5 to £15 | Find event and ticket information for Gushing with Gabby\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function updateStickyTicketButton(hasTickets) {\n\n            var button = document.getElementById('stickyTicketButton');\n\n            if (!button) return;\n\n            if (hasTickets) {\n                button.href = '#checkout';\n            }\n            else {\n                button.href = '#anchor';\n            }\n        }\r\n\r\nfunction startConfirm(button, shouldValidate) {\r\n\r\n    // Run custom validation if this page has it\r\n    if (typeof validate === 'function' && shouldValidate) {\r\n        if (!validate()) {\r\n            return false;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // Prevent a second click\r\n    if (button.dataset.processing === 'true') {\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    button.dataset.processing = 'true';\r\n    button.classList.add('is-loading');\r\n\r\n            return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\nwindow.addEventListener('pageshow', function() {\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.loading-button').forEach(function(button) {\n        button.dataset.processing = 'false';\n        button.classList.remove('is-loading');\n    });\n\n});\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n            if (x.type === \"password\") {\r\n                x.type = \"text\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                x.type = \"password\";\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showShareModal() {\r\n            $('#shareModal').reveal({\r\n                animation: 'fadeAndPop',                   //fade, fadeAndPop, none\r\n                animationspseeed: 300,                       //how fast animtions are\r\n                closeonbackgroundclick: true,              //if you click background will modal close?\r\n                dismissmodalclass: 'close-reveal-modal'    //the class of a button or element that will close an open modal\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-57x57.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-60x60.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-72x72.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-76x76.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-114x114.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"120x120\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-120x120.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-144x144.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"152x152\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-152x152.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-180x180.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"192x192\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/android-icon-192x192.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"96x96\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-96x96.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-16x16.png\" /><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon.ico\" /><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\" /><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"OutSavvy\" /><meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" /><meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#ffffff\" /><meta name=\"msapplication-TileImage\" content=\"/ms-icon-144x144.png\" /><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\" /><meta name=\"google-play-app\" content=\"app-id=com.outsavvyapp\" /><meta name=\"apple-itunes-app\" content=\"app-id=722344276\" /><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" /><meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"179821335543821\" />\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n\r\n        function sponsoredclick(boostId, eventId, source) {\r\n            $.ajax({\r\n                type: \"POST\",\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                url: \"/Default.aspx/AddBoostClick\",\r\n                data: '{ userId: \"06902969-bec4-4bf1-973c-9a50af748559\", boostId: \"' + boostId + '\", eventId: \"' + eventId + '\", source: \"' + source + '\" }',\r\n                contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                dataType: \"json\",\r\n                success: function (r) {\r\n                    var g = 'success';\r\n                },\r\n                failure: function (r) {\r\n                },\r\n                error: function (r) {\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function sponsoredview(boostId, source) {\r\n            $.ajax({\r\n                type: \"POST\",\