85 19.6569 9 18 9C16.3431 9 15 7.65685 15 6C15 4.34315 16.3431 3 18 3C19.6569 3 21 4.34315 21 6Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 18C21 19.6569 19.6569 21 18 21C16.3431 21 15 19.6569 15 18C15 16.3431 16.3431 15 18 15C19.6569 15 21 16.3431 21 18Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.7207 10.6397L15.0001 7.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.70605 13.353L15 16.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                        </svg>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro lazy\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">GODDESS BUNNY</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p>Goddess Bunny Superstar film screening&nbsp;</p><p>Performance by Midgitte Bardot</p><p>Hosted by Midgitte Bardot | Presented by Gushing | Live at Chats Palace</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This event is a tribute evening dedicated to Goddess Bunny. We will share a test screening of the unreleased film Goddess Bunny Superstar (2026), hosted by Midgitte Bardot and presented by Gushing, followed by a special live performance by Midgitte Bardot. This evening is inspired by Goddess Bunny and offers an opportunity to collectively reflect on her life and legacy. We will celebrate trans, intersex, queer and disabled identities and provide a relaxed moment for connection and gathering on the occasion of Trans Day of Remembrance at queer venue Chats Palace.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you to Chats Palace, Matthew Patrick and Hackney Council for the generous support as part of Hackney PRIDE365.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SCHEDULE:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>5.30pm&nbsp;: Doors open</p><p>6.30pm: Theatre doors open (priority for people with access needs)</p><p>7-7.45pm: Screening part of unreleased film Goddess Bunny Superstar (2026) (45 mins)&nbsp;</p><p>7.45-8.05pm: Break (20 mins)</p><p>8.05-8.35pm: Live performance by Midgitte Bardot (30 mins)</p><p>8.35-10.30pm: Reflection, socialising, drinks at the bar</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a short introduction to Goddess Bunny, see ‘Goddess Bunny: The Forgotten story of a Hollywood Icon’ film by Dazed: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DMJeWH_sUVg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DMJeWH_sUVg</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>ACCESS NEEDS:&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you have access needs and would like priority seating, please let our door person know on arrival so we can call you to take your place earlier. Film is not captioned.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>TAXI FUND:&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We have a modest access budget towards taxis for disabled people's travel to/from this event.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you’d like to be considered for this please get in touch once you’ve booked a ticket for the event. As funds are limited they will be allocated on a first come first served basis. Please email&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:gabby@gushing.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\"><u>gabby@gushing.co.uk</u></a> if you’d like to be on this list and reimbursements will be made after the event, with proof of taxi receipt, up to the maximum budget we have available, and a maximum of £15 per person.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>VENUE ACCESS:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is step-free access into the building and the ground floor, with double doors throughout. There is an accessible toilet. The event will have a mix of low level soft seating, cabaret tables, theatre style seating, tall stools with tall tables, and wheelchair access.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For more information on venue accessibility:&nbsp;</p><p>https://chatspalace.com/access/ venue@chatspalace.com 0203 866 7195&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Photo credit:</p><p>Left: Goddess Bunny by Chuck Grant via NYT. Right: Midgitte Bardot by Holly Revell.</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Chats+Palace%2c+42-44+Brooksbys+Walk%2c+London%2c+E9+6DF\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0428147&lat=51.55023&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Chats+Palace%2c+42-44+Brooksbys+Walk%2c+London%2c+E9+6DF\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 250\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0428147&lat=51.55023&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n            <p><span class=locName>Chats Palace</span><br/>42-44 Brooksbys Walk, London, E9 6DF</p>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tagged\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\">\r\n  <title>location</title>\r\n  <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\r\n    <g id=\"invisible_box\" data-name=\"invisible box\