            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 6C21 7.65685 19.6569 9 18 9C16.3431 9 15 7.65685 15 6C15 4.34315 16.3431 3 18 3C19.6569 3 21 4.34315 21 6Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 18C21 19.6569 19.6569 21 18 21C16.3431 21 15 19.6569 15 18C15 16.3431 16.3431 15 18 15C19.6569 15 21 16.3431 21 18Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.7207 10.6397L15.0001 7.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.70605 13.353L15 16.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                        </svg>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro lazy\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Afro Sci-Fi Film Club 4 the Global Majority [queer & neurodivergent friendly]</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><h3>Afro Sci-Fi Film Club 4 the Global Majority [queer &amp; neurodivergent friendly]</h3><p>A film night for POC with niche interests. For fans of sci-fi, futuristic things, de-colonising space, mind benders, dystopias and alien vibes - with a lil discussion afterwards to talk about the film&nbsp;★</p><p>[soft drinks available to purchase at The Common Press + bring your own snacks]</p><p>The purpose is to create a casual gathering of sci-fi film lovers who haven’t been able to take up space in a genre that’s typically predominantly white and to expand the narratives of science fiction from other cultures, featuring sci-fi films that focus on black &amp; brown narratives.&nbsp;</p><p>Beginning with a focus on Afro-sci fi, the intention is to continue watching films from other cultural identities and heritages that explore sci-fi in their own ways too. A place where it’s okay to feel off in the world &amp; recreate <img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:32/32;height:1.2em;width:1.2em;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1fa90/32.png\" alt=\"🪐\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;</p><p>With an intention to set these up regularly, this is a re-launch to set the ball rolling again..&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After a wonderful return last month with <i>Crumbs</i>, our next screening takes us to Cameroon, with <i>Les Saignantes.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Please note, this event is POC Only</strong></p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:600/800;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/aec79b6e-869f-4422-ba3f-4e6e69665e1e.jpeg  \" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></figure><p><strong>Title:</strong> Les Saignantes [The Bleeders]</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Film description:</strong>&nbsp;Sci-Fi Erotic Horror set in Cameroon: Vampiric femmes fatales emasculate high-ranking Cameroonian officials through ancient rituals of Mevoungou [contains nudity]</p><p><strong>Trailer:</strong>&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kesSVI-FXjc?si=AAoF_BUwd3_H2-tl\">https://youtu.be/kesSVI-FXjc?si=AAoF_BUwd3_H2-tl</a></p><p><strong>Schedule Outline:</strong></p><p><strong>18:30</strong> - Doors Open</p><p><strong>19:00</strong> - Film Starts</p><p><strong>20:30</strong> - Film ends</p><p><strong>20:40</strong> - Discussion on film</p><p><strong>21:30</strong> - Event ends</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Organiser:</strong>&nbsp;Niito [artist name iNKOGNiiTO]&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:69.99%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1536/2048;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/3f9a706e-251a-40f5-a222-7e1501b8359b.jpeg  \" width=\"1536\" height=\"2048\"></figure><p>A music/visual artist and cinema projectionist - currently bleeding the concept of their artistry into reality through curating queer &amp; neurodivergent friendly black &amp; brown centred sci-fi film nights. Niito is starting to explore cosmic re-indiginising in micro communities. Curating spaces that de-center the white gaze through a sci-fi lens to create an alternative futuristic scene.&nbsp;</p><p>Other key words: speculative non-fiction, decolonising space, afro nomads, befriending alienation, mundane absurdism.</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=The+Common+Press+Shoreditch%2c+118++Bethnal+Green+Road%2c+London%2c+E2+6DG\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0711741&lat=51.52496&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=The+Common+Press+Shoreditch%2c+118++Bethnal+Green+Road%2c+London%2c+E2+6DG\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 250\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0711741&lat=51.52496&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n            <p><span class=locName>The Common Press Shoreditch</span><br/>118  Bethnal Green Road, London, E2 6DG</p>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tagged\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\">\r\n  <title>location</title>\r\n  <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\r\n    <g id=\"invisible_box\" data-name=\"invisible box\">\r\n      <rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"none\"/>\r\n    </g>\r\n    <g id=\"icons_Q2\" data-name=\"icons Q2\">\r\n      <path d=\"M24,14a3,3,0,1,1-3,3,2.9,2.9,0,0,1,3-3m0-4a7,7,0,1,0,7,7,7,7,0,0,0-7-7Z\"/>\r\n      <path d=\"M24,6c7.4,0,13,6,13,14S28.4,36.7,24,41.2C19.6,36.7,11,27.5,11,20S16.6,6,24,6m0-4C14.1,2,7,10.1,7,20S18.5,41.3,22.6,45.4a1.9,1.9,0,0,0,2.8,0C29.5,41.3,41,30.1,41,20S33.9,2,24,2Z\"/>\r\n    </g>\r\n  </g>\r\n</svg><span>London Events</span></a><a href=/hashtag/commonpress><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" height=\"25px\" width=\"25px\" version=\"1.1\" id=\"_x32_\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<g>\r\n\t<path class=\"st0\" d=\"M320.707,0L37.037,69.971v417.625L320.447,512l154.516-26.258V62.568L320.707,0z M290.346,471.742   l-92.584-7.974v-79.426l-55.086-0.677v75.36l-68.109-5.866V99.367l215.779-53.224V471.742z\"/>\r\n\t<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"271.25,76.933 226.537,86.32 226.537,138.956 271.25,131.246  \"/>\r\n\t<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"118.574,112.033 87.416,118.622 87.416,164.818 118.574,159.469  \"/>\r\n\t<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"190.012,95.942 150.426,104.23 150.426,153.027 190.012,146.202  \"/>\r\n\t<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"118.576,203.184 87.416,207.448 87.416,253.722 118.576,250.622  \"/>\r\n\t<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"190.012,192.792 150.426,198.154 150.426,246.952 190.012,243.052  \"/>\r\n\t<polygo