          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tCAMP x CAMP CLASSICS presents VEGAS IN SPACE +afterparty at The Divine Tickets | 26 Nov @ The Divine, London | FREE to £9 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7769677a7968bf74e504bc7599959c8f5cdfe69ca94b0638a17c981254064d3f3540f1cb22d8839bc7820c9608d113eb98efe7ea68fbf7cc1ac3c817446e0c56/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-11-03\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"On November 26th, for ONE NIGHT ONLY, queer party CAMP teams up with queer film club CAMP CLASSICS at The Divine, for THE CAMPEST NIGHT OF THE YEAR. No other place can you get your nails done, watch a film, see a drag show, and have a dance all in one gloriously camp evening. With performances by Olli Banks (@ollibanks), Mark Crampton (@irish_nosher), AND nails from Mason (@droopyleftlid). Followed by afterparty with CAMP DJs @danieleckhoff b2b @cool.boy.club. Afterparty included in &#163;9 screening ticket, &#163;9 OTD for CAMP afterparty. For this legendary event, we are screening Vegas in Space (1991). Three male soldiers are ordered to change their sex (via a pill) and are sent on an undercover mission as showgirls to the female-dominated planet of Clitoris, where they must manoeuver complex politics and decadent parties to uncover a plot to disrupt the most important pleasure planet in the Universe. A drag queen space adventure filmed in &quot;Glamourama&quot; that was inspired by a drag queen theme party thrown by Ginger Quest. Filmed entirely in one apartment (on a budget paid for with sex work), this film is absolute bliss insanity.  Doors 6:30 (basement)Film 7-9 (w/ interval+performances)Party 9-1 (upstairs) CAMP is a london-based queer party centred on silly extravagant over-the-top fun. CAMP welcomes everyone, especially those ready to act a fool and serve ridiculous looks, with a new theme at every event. CAMP founders @danieleckhoff and @cool.boy.club wanted to distil the frenetic energy of house parties and the playful escapism of fancy dress, creating the ultimate dress-up party for all clowns and queers in London.  With an incredible selection of local queer talent, every CAMP party promises a night of dancing and surprises. Expect silly poppy remixes + energetic bouncy sounds ♪(๑ᴖ◡ᴖ๑)♪ CAMP CLASSICS is a queer film club run by @ty_chapman. We screen films that are queer, camp, silly, retro, sometimes glazed over, or with cult followings, but mostly films that make you realise you don’t need a trillion-dollar budget and an all-star cast to make a film that has an impact. CAMP CLASSICS is a great place to meet other queers with twisted minds so come for giggles and stay for vibes. &amp;lt;3 ACCESS INFO:Unfortunately, both floors of The Divine are not currently accessible as we do nothave a lift.- The ground floor, main bar of The Divine has level access.- There is an accessible toilet in the main bar.- The cabaret and club space are in the basement of the venue. There is no lift.- There are 17 wide steps down to the basement with handrails on either side, this iswhere the show will take place.- There are two sets of gender-neutral toilets downstairs, they are not wide enoughfor wheelchairs.If you need further information, please refer to The Divine ‘About’ page on thewebsite. www.thedivine.co.uk or email us direct on info@thedivine.co.uk\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"CAMP x CAMP CLASSICS presents VEGAS IN SPACE +afterparty at The Divine Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40809/camp-x-camp-classics-presents-vegas-in-space-afterparty-at-the-divine\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/d84d11b9-ce2b-45e8-9413-f25d891a150a.jpeg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"CAMP x CAMP CLASSICS presents VEGAS IN SPACE +afterparty at The Divine Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40809/camp-x-camp-classics-presents-vegas-in-space-afterparty-at-the-divine\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/d84d11b9-ce2b-45e8-9413-f25d891a150a.jpeg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"On November 26th, for ONE NIGHT ONLY, queer party CAMP teams up with queer film club CAMP CLASSICS at The Divine, for THE CAMPEST NIGHT OF THE YEAR. No other place can you get your nails done, watch a film, see a drag show, and have a dance all in one gloriously camp evening. With performances by Olli Banks (@ollibanks), Mark Crampton (@irish_nosher), AND nails from Mason (@droopyleftlid). Followed by afterparty with CAMP DJs @danieleckhoff b2b @cool.boy.club. Afterparty included in &#163;9 screening ticket, &#163;9 OTD for CAMP afterparty. For this legendary event, we are screening Vegas in Space (1991). Three male soldiers are ordered to change their sex (via a pill) and are sent on an undercover mission as showgirls to the female-dominated planet of Clitoris, where they must manoeuver complex politics and decadent parties to uncover a plot to disrupt the most important pleasure planet in the Universe. A drag queen space adventure filmed in &quot;Glamourama&quot; that was inspired by a drag queen theme party thrown by Ginger Quest. Filmed entirely in one apartment (on a budget paid for with sex work), this film is absolute bliss insanity.  Doors 6:30 (basement)Film 7-9 (w/ interval+performances)Party 9-1 (upstairs) CAMP is a london-based queer party centred on silly extravagant over-the-top fun. CAMP welcomes everyone, especially those ready to act a fool and serve ridiculous looks, with a new theme at every event. CAMP founders @danieleckhoff and @cool.boy.club wanted to distil the frenetic energy of house parties and the playful escapism of fancy dress, creating the ultimate dress-up party for all clowns and queers in London.  With an incredible selection of local queer talent, every CAMP party promises a night of dancing and surprises. Expect silly poppy remixes + energetic bouncy sounds ♪(๑ᴖ◡ᴖ๑)♪ CAMP CLASSICS is a queer film club run by @ty_chapman. We screen films that are queer, camp, silly, retro, sometimes glazed over, or with cult followings, but mostly films that make you realise you don’t need a trillion-dollar budget and an all-star cast to make a film that has an impact. CAMP CLASSICS is a great place to meet other queers with twisted minds so come for giggles and stay for vibes. &amp;lt;3 ACCESS INFO:Unfortunately, both floors of The Divine are not currently accessible as we do nothave a lift.- The ground floor, main bar of The Divine has level access.- There is an accessible toilet in the main bar.- The cabaret and club space are in the basement of the venue. There is no lift.- There are 17 wide steps down to the basement with handrails on either side, this iswhere the show will take place.- There are two sets of gender-neutral toilets downstairs, they are not wide enoughfor wheelchairs.If you need further information, please refer to The Divine ‘About’ page on thewebsite. www.thedivine.co.uk or email us direct on info@thedivine.co.uk\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40809/camp-x-camp-classics-presents-vegas-in-space-afterparty-at-the-divine\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | CAMP x CAMP CLASSICS presents VEGAS IN SPACE +afterparty at The Divine | Thursday 26th November 2026 @ The Divine | FREE to £9 | Find event and ticket information for CAMP CLASSICS\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function updateStickyTicketButton(hasTickets) {\n\n            var button = document.getElementById('stickyTicketButton');\n\n            if (!button) return;\n\n            if (hasTickets) {\n                button.href = '#checkout';\n            }\n            else {\n                button.href = '#anchor';\n            }\n        }\r\n\r\nfunction startConfirm(button, shouldValidate) {\r\n\r\n    // Run custom validation if this page has it\r\n    if (typeof validate === 'function' && shouldValidate) {\r\n        if (!validate()) {\r\n            return false;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // Prevent a second click\r\n    if (button.dataset.processing === 'true') {\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    button.dataset.processing = 'true';\r\n    button.classList.add('is-loading');\r\n\r\n            return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\nwindow.addEventListener('pageshow', function() {\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.loading-button').forEach(function(button) {\n        button.dataset.processing = 'false';\n        button.classList.remove('is-loading');\n    });\n\n});\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n            if (x.type === \"password\") {\r\n                x.type = \"text\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                x.type = \"password\";\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showShareModal() {\r\n            $('#shareModal').reveal({\r\n                animation: 'fadeAndPop',                   //fade, fadeAndPop, none\r\n                animationspseeed: 300,                       //how fast animtions are\r\n                closeonbackgroundclick: true,              //if you click background will modal close?\r\n                dismissmodalclass: 'close-reveal-modal'    //the class of a button or element that will close an open modal\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-57x57.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\"