ible Parking Spaces, Complimentary Ticket for Assistant</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"shareevent2\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 100%; margin-top: 5px; text-align: center;\" class=\"sharevent jssocials\">\r\n                            <div class=\"jssocials-shares\">\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"jssocials-share\">\r\n\r\n                                    <div onclick=\"loveevent(40777)\" class='like-button' title=\"Unlove This Event\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                                        <div class='like-icon'>\r\n                                            <div class='heart-animation-1'></div>\r\n                                            <div class='heart-animation-2'></div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"jssocials-share\">\r\n\r\n                                    <div onclick=\"showShareModal()\" class=\"jssocials-share jssocials-share-share\" style=\"cursor: pointer; margin: 0;\" data-original-title=\"Share This Event\">\r\n\r\n                                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28px\" height=\"28px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\r\n                                            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M21 6C21 7.65685 19.6569 9 18 9C16.3431 9 15 7.65685 15 6C15 4.34315 16.3431 3 18 3C19.6569 3 21 4.34315 21 6Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M21 18C21 19.6569 19.6569 21 18 21C16.3431 21 15 19.6569 15 18C15 16.3431 16.3431 15 18 15C19.6569 15 21 16.3431 21 18Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 6C21 7.65685 19.6569 9 18 9C16.3431 9 15 7.65685 15 6C15 4.34315 16.3431 3 18 3C19.6569 3 21 4.34315 21 6Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 18C21 19.6569 19.6569 21 18 21C16.3431 21 15 19.6569 15 18C15 16.3431 16.3431 15 18 15C19.6569 15 21 16.3431 21 18Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.7207 10.6397L15.0001 7.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.70605 13.353L15 16.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                        </svg>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro lazy\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Programmers of Tomorrow: Film Festival All-Dayer</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p>The <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://cinemaoftomorrow.com\">Cinema of Tomorrow</a> presents a film festival all-dayer where <strong>3 people/collectives will screen films in public for the 1st time</strong>, and the audience gets <strong>3 shows for the price of 1</strong>! This is the grand finale of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://cinemaoftomorrow.substack.com/p/programmers-of-tomorrow-a-season\">Programmers of Tomorrow: A Season of Workshops and Screenings for the Future of Film Exhibition</a> (PoT). Come on down for some eclectic movies, truly fresh programming and heaps of do-it-together community spirit.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Line-up</strong><br>Doors will be open 45 mins before each screening (and 15 minutes after the screenings have started).&nbsp;<br>Although your ticket is for the entire day and allows for re-entry please do not arrive in the middle of a film.</p><p>12.45 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://letterboxd.com/film/talking-about-trees/\">Talking About Trees</a> (2019), presented by Talking About Trees</p><p>3.30 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://letterboxd.com/film/emuthi-puthi/\">Emuthi Puthi </a>(2022), presented by Brown Women in Film</p><p>6.30 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://letterboxd.com/film/speed-racer/\">Speed Racer</a> (2008), presented by Simran Sanghera</p><p><strong>Food</strong><br>Empanadas (veg &amp; meaty) and pot noodles with a selection of exciting toppings will be available. The museum also has a licensed bar, soft drinks and snacks.</p><p><strong>Shopping</strong><br>A physical media stall will be piled high with zines, VHSs and film culture treats to take home with you.</p><p><strong>Fundraiser</strong><br>Proceeds for this event are split evenly between supporting the Programmers of Tomorrow and its venue, the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://cinemamuseum.org.uk/\">Cinema Museum</a> in Kennington. The museum is <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.crowdfunder.co.uk/p/the-cinema-museum-buy-our-home\">currently raising money</a> to buy its amazing building and cement its place as the living archive of London's cinema history.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Access</strong><br>There is one step to get into the museum, and a lift to get into the screening hall.<br>Accessible and all gender toilets available. Carers free, service dogs welcome.<br><br>No one turned away for lack of funds (NOTAFLOF). Please email us for a discounted or free ticket.<br>If you have any other questions or requests do get in touch!<br>cinemaoftomorrowldn@gmail.com</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://cinemaoftomorrow.com\"><strong>Cinema of Tomorrow&nbsp;</strong></a>is a film club and microcinema in the making for South East London</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=The+Cinema+Museum%2c+2+Dugard+Way%2c+London%2c+SE11+4TH\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.1052203&lat=51.49229&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=The+Cinema+Museum%2c+2+Dugard+Way%2c+London%2c+SE11+4TH\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 250\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.1052203&lat=51.49229&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n            <p><span class=locName>The Cinema Museum</span><br/>2 Dugard Way, London, SE11 4TH</p>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tagged\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\">\r\n  <title>location</title>\r\n  <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\r\n    <g id=\"invisible_box\" data-name=\"invisible box\">\r\n      