            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tTRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: Veneno (Episodes 1, 2, 3) Tickets | 02 Dec @ Dalston Superstore, London | Pay What You Can to £5 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7769677a7968bf74e504bc7599959c8f5cdfe69ca94b0638a17c981254064d3f3540f1cb22d8839bc7820c9608d113eb98efe7ea68fbf7cc1ac3c817446e0c56/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-11-03\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Thrilling, complex, explicit, and never less than spectacularly affecting, Veneno (2020) weaves trans histories and contemporary Madrid together in a story that spans decades, stars countless trans actors, and blows the wheels off every crumb of “representation” that came before it.Telling the story of real-life trans icon Cristina “La Veneno” Ortiz, while also charting the emerging womanhood of Valeria Vegas, a young journalist who would become Veneno&#39;s biographer, this eight-episode miniseries is a sprawling, maximalist ode to transness, storytelling, and the mythic legacy of what feels like a kind of trans superhero.Don&#39;t miss the start of our full series run of Veneno (2020), beginning with the first three episodes of this miraculous beauty by directors Javier Calvo and Javier Ambrossi (La Bola Negra). Episodes will screen with one 10min and one 15min intermission.Screening will begin 15min after the advertised time instead of our usual half hour. Episodes will screen in Spanish with English subtitles.Seating is a mixture of backed chairs, benches, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: Veneno (Episodes 1, 2, 3) Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/a3d1dd61-d86f-4ee1-b562-aa5f31e7b77e.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: Veneno (Episodes 1, 2, 3) Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/a3d1dd61-d86f-4ee1-b562-aa5f31e7b77e.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Thrilling, complex, explicit, and never less than spectacularly affecting, Veneno (2020) weaves trans histories and contemporary Madrid together in a story that spans decades, stars countless trans actors, and blows the wheels off every crumb of “representation” that came before it.Telling the story of real-life trans icon Cristina “La Veneno” Ortiz, while also charting the emerging womanhood of Valeria Vegas, a young journalist who would become Veneno&#39;s biographer, this eight-episode miniseries is a sprawling, maximalist ode to transness, storytelling, and the mythic legacy of what feels like a kind of trans superhero.Don&#39;t miss the start of our full series run of Veneno (2020), beginning with the first three episodes of this miraculous beauty by directors Javier Calvo and Javier Ambrossi (La Bola Negra). Episodes will screen with one 10min and one 15min intermission.Screening will begin 15min after the advertised time instead of our usual half hour. Episodes will screen in Spanish with English subtitles.Seating is a mixture of backed chairs, benches, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: Veneno (Episodes 1, 2, 3) | Wednesday 2nd December 2026 @ Dalston Superstore | Pay What You Can to £5 | Find event and ticket information for TRANSMISSIONS\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function updateStickyTicketButton(hasTickets) {\n\n            var button = document.getElementById('stickyTicketButton');\n\n            if (!button) return;\n\n            if (hasTickets) {\n                button.href = '#checkout';\n            }\n            else {\n                button.href = '#anchor';\n            }\n        }\r\n\r\nfunction startConfirm(button, shouldValidate) {\r\n\r\n    // Run custom validation if this page has it\r\n    if (typeof validate === 'function' && shouldValidate) {\r\n        if (!validate()) {\r\n            return false;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // Prevent a second click\r\n    if (button.dataset.processing === 'true') {\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    button.dataset.processing = 'true';\r\n    button.classList.add('is-loading');\r\n\r\n            return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\nwindow.addEventListener('pageshow', function() {\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.loading-button').forEach(function(button) {\n        button.dataset.processing = 'false';\n        button.classList.remove('is-loading');\n    });\n\n});\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n            if (x.type === \"password\") {\r\n                x.type = \"text\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                x.type = \"password\";\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showShareModal() {\r\n            $('#shareModal').reveal({\r\n                animation: 'fadeAndPop',                   //fade, fadeAndPop, none\r\n                animationspseeed: 300,                       //how fast animtions are\r\n                closeonbackgroundclick: true,              //if you click background will modal close?\r\n                dismissmodalclass: 'close-reveal-modal'    //the class of a button or element that will close an open modal\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-57x57.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-60x60.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-72x72.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-76x76.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-114x114.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"120x120\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-120x120.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-144x144.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"152x152\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-152x152.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-180x180.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"192x192\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/android-icon-192x192.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"96x96\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-96x96.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-16x16.png\" /><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon.ico\" /><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\" /><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"OutSa