                        </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: Veneno (Episodes 1, 2, 3)\",\"startDate\": \"2026-12-02T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-12-02T22:00:00+00:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/a3d1dd61-d86f-4ee1-b562-aa5f31e7b77e.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"Thrilling, complex, explicit, and never less than spectacularly affecting, Veneno (2020) weaves trans histories and contemporary Madrid together in a story that spans decades, stars countless trans actors, and blows the wheels off every crumb of “representation” that came before it.Telling the story of real-life trans icon Cristina “La Veneno” Ortiz, while also charting the emerging womanhood of Valeria Vegas, a young journalist who would become Veneno&#39;s biographer, this eight-episode miniseries is a sprawling, maximalist ode to transness, storytelling, and the mythic legacy of what feels like a kind of trans superhero.Don&#39;t miss the start of our full series run of Veneno (2020), beginning with the first three episodes of this miraculous beauty by directors Javier Calvo and Javier Ambrossi (La Bola Negra). Episodes will screen with one 10min and one 15min intermission.Screening will begin 15min after the advertised time instead of our usual half hour. Episodes will screen in Spanish with English subtitles.Seating is a mixture of backed chairs, benches, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Dalston Superstore\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Dalston Superstore, 117 Kingsland High Street\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E8 2PB\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.5501\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0753984\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-12-02T18:00:00+00:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\",\"lowPrice\":5,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-15T22:49:17+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-15T22:49:17+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-12-02T18:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Free Entry (suggested for trans attendees)\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-10-13T00:58:07+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-10-13T00:58:07+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-12-02T18:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Donor Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\",\"price\":5,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-10-13T00:58:07+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-10-13T00:58:07+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-12-02T18:00:00+00:00\",\"name\":\"Pay what you can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-15T22:49:17+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-15T22:49:17+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/transmissions1\", \"description\" : \"\", \"name\" : \"TRANSMISSIONS\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 41105,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 2433,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.add(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Following\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/41105/transmissions-presents-veneno-episodes-1-2-3';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            if (document.body.classList.contains('is-following')) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.remove(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").hide();\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\", isWebsite: true }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").slideDown(\"slow\", function () {\r\n                                // Animation complete.\r\n                            });\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            let check = false;\r\n            (function (a) { if (/(android|bb\\d+|meego).+mobile|avantgo|bada\\/|blackberry|blazer|compal|elaine|fennec|hiptop|iemobile|ip(hone|od)|iris|kindle|lge |maemo|midp|mmp|mobile.+firefox|netfront|opera m(ob|in)i|palm( os)?|phone|p(ixi|re)\\/|plucker|pocket|psp|series(4|6)0|symbian|treo|up\\.(browser|link)|vodafone|wap|windows ce|xda|xiino/i.test(a) || /1207|6310|6590|3gso|4thp|50[1-6]i|770s|802s|a wa|abac|ac(er|oo|s\\-)|ai(ko|rn)|al(av|ca|co)|amoi|an(ex|ny|yw)|aptu|ar(ch|go)|as(te|us)|attw|au(di|\\-m|r |s )|avan|be(ck|ll|nq)|bi(lb|rd)|bl(ac|az)|br(e|v)w|bumb|bw\\-(n|u)|c55\\/|capi|ccwa|cdm\\-|cell|chtm|cldc|cmd\\-|co(mp|nd)|craw|da(it|ll|ng)|dbte|dc\\-s|devi|dica|dmob|do(c|p)o|ds(12|\\-d)|el(49|ai)|em(l2|ul)|er(ic|k0)|esl8|ez([4-7]0|os|wa|ze)|fetc|fly(\\-|_)|g1 u|g560|gene|gf\\-5|g\\-mo|go(\\.w|od)|gr(ad|un)|haie|hcit|hd\\-(m|p|t)|hei\\-|hi(pt|ta)|hp( i|ip)|hs\\-c|ht(c(\\-| |_|a|g|p|s|t)|tp)|hu(aw|tc)|i\\-(20|go|ma)|i230|iac( |\\-|\\/)|ibro|idea|ig01|ikom|im1k|inno|ipaq|iris|ja(t|v)a|jbro|jemu|jigs|kddi|keji|kgt( |\\/)|klon|kpt |kwc\\-|kyo(c|k)|le(no|xi)|lg( g|\\/(k|l|u)|50|54|\\-[a-w])|libw|lynx|m1\\-w|m3ga|m50\\/|ma(te|ui|xo)|mc(01|21|ca)|m\\-cr|me(rc|ri)|mi(o8|oa|ts)|mmef|mo(01|02|bi|de|do|t(\\-| |o|v)|zz)|mt(50|p1|v )|mwbp|mywa|n10[0-2]|n20[2-3]|n30(0|2)|n50(0|2|5)|n7(0(0|1)|10)|ne((c|m)\\-|on|tf|wf|wg|wt)|nok(6|i)|nzph|o2im|op(ti|wv)|oran|owg1|p800|pan(a|d|t)|pdxg|pg(13|\\-([1-8]|c))|phil|pire|pl(ay|uc)|pn\\-2|po(ck|rt|se)|prox|psio|pt\\-g|qa\\-a|qc(07|12|21|32|60|\\-[2-7]|i\\-)|qtek|r380|r600|raks|rim9|ro(ve|zo)|s55\\/|sa(ge|ma|mm|ms|ny|va)|sc(01|h\\-|oo|p\\-)|sdk\\/|se(c(\\-|0|1)|47|mc|nd|ri)|sgh\\-|shar|sie(\\-|m)|sk\\-0|sl(45|id)|sm(al|ar|b3|it|t5)|so(ft|ny)|sp(01|h\\-|v\\-|v )|sy(01|mb)|t2(18|50)|t6(00|10|18)|ta(gt|lk)|tcl\\-|tdg\\-|tel(i|m)|tim\\-|t\\-mo|to(pl|sh)|ts(70|m\\-|m3|m5)|tx\\-9|up(\\.b|g1|si)|utst|v400|v750|veri|vi(rg|te)|vk(40|5[0-3]|\\-v)|vm40|voda|vulc|vx(52|53|60|61|70|80|81|83|85|98)|w3c(\\-| )|webc|whit|wi(g |nc|nw)|wmlb|wonu|x700|yas\\-|your|zeto|zte\\-/i.test(a.substr(0, 4))) check = true; })(navigator.userAgent || navigator.vendor || window.opera);\r\n            if (check) {\r\n                $(\".mobile-share\").show();\r\n                $(\".web-share\").hide();\r\n            } else {\r\n                $(\".mobile-share\").hide();\r\n                $(\".web-share\").show();\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            const copy = document.getElementById('copybutton');\r\n            const input = document.getElementById('copyinput');\r\n            const field = document.querySelector(\".share-copy\");\r\n\r\n            try {\r\n                copy.onclick = () => {\r\n                    input.select(); //select input value\r\n\r\n                    if (document.execCommand(\"copy\")) { //if the selected text is copied\r\n                        field.classList.add(\"active\");\r\n                        copy.innerText = \"Copied\";\r\n                        setTimeout(() => {\r\n                            window.getSelection().removeAllRanges(); //remove selection from page\r\n                            field.classList.remove(\"active\");\r\n                            copy.innerText = \"Copy\";\r\n                        }, 3000);\r\n                    }\r\n                    return false;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            catch (ex) {\r\n                Log(\"Caught exception: \" + ex);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n\r\n         \r\n\r\n        const musicContainer = document.getElementById('music-container');\r\n\r\n        const title = document.getElementById('title');\r\n        const progressContainer = document.getElementById('progress-container');\r\n        const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\r\n\r\n        const audio = document.getElementById('audio');\r\n        const cover = document.getElementById('cover');\r\n\r\n        const playButton = document.getElementById('play');\r\n\r\n        const play = document.getElementById('playbutton');\r\n        const pause = document.getElementById('pausebutton');\r\n\r\n        const mute = document.getElementById('mute');\r\n        const full = document.getElementById('full');\r\n        const volumeBar = document.getElementById('volume-bar');\r\n        const volume = document.getElementById('volume');\r\n\r\n        // play song\r\n        function playSong() {\r\n            musicContainer.classList.add('play');\r\n\r\n\r\n            pause.classList.remove('buttonHide');\r\n            play.classList.add('buttonHide');\r\n\r\n            audio.play();\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // pause song\r\n        function pauseSong() {\r\n            musicContainer.classList.remove('play');\r\n\r\n            play.classList.remove('buttonHide');\r\n            pause.classList.add('buttonHide');\r\n\r\n            audio.pause();\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // set progress \r\n        function setProgress(e) {\r\n            const width = this.clientWidth;\r\n            const clickX = e.offsetX;\r\n            const duration = audio.duration;\r\n\r\n            audio.currentTime = (clickX / width) * duration;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // Update Progress \r\n        function updateProgress(e) {\r\n            const { duration, currentTime } = e.srcElement;\r\n            const progessPercent = (currentTime / duration) * 100;\r\n            progress.style.width = `${progessPercent}%`;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // Mute volume\r\n        function muteVolume() {\r\n            audio.volume = 0;\r\n            volume.style.width = `0%`;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // Full volume\r\n        function fullVolume() {\r\n            audio.volume = 1.0;\r\n            volume.style.width = `100%`;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // Volumn bar\r\n        function setVolume(e) {\r\n            const width = this.clientWidth;\r\n            const clickX = e.offsetX;\r\n            const offset = (clickX / width) * 100;\r\n            const percent = (1 * offset) / 100;\r\n            audio.volume = percent;\r\n            volume.style.width = `${offset}%`;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // event listeners\r\n        playButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n            const isPlaying = musicContainer.classList.contains('play');\r\n\r\n            if (isPlaying) {\r\n                pauseSong();\r\n            }\r\n            else {\r\n                playSong();\r\n            }\r\n        })\r\n\r\n        // Time/ SOng update \r\n        audio.addEventListener('timeupdate', updateProgress);\r\n\r\n        // click on progress bar \r\n        progressContainer.addEventListener('click', setProgress);\r\n\r\n        audio.addEventListener('ended', pauseSong);\r\n\r\n        // volume icons click\r\n        mute.addEventListener('click', muteVolume);\r\n        full.addEventListener('click', fullVolume);\r\n\r\n        volumeBar.addEventListener('click', setVolume);\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/popupCss/a9abea2b16e5ad6faa8e19dfde9eae3c4ca68f4c7f1fea7e0b2f9df0840262e66a8cbec0e7367b5e55e6ef24650279ffb85e837108c5e9e665ffa1f86b5ebdbb/\"/>\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/popupJs/e1690ce050304f62b37c784a0f8aec5388984caf20235321a8f75053dbf9c5890272305f905b47c4a53d3ed785ff3ae726e128104f6df961dd9e665a31498d37/\"></script>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/extraJs/0fef482fbeca47d6417280ca3d0505f298dfcbce0509b9a8877caf157e2f613b1b5067787e7cc927151909b97d44724d2d5f82b962d2e26c21d88aef7fe4f6d7/\"></script>\r\n\r\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/extraCss/b1c01ef5371569d778a0d72fd5d7a3e6df14ab8489d7bd24fd5e7218b25562a65ea6d41d13ff037f8c5528ba8f29ff9280f2c30315ac65bdaf7e63195ae8dc88/\"/>\r\n\r\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n            if (typeof (Sys) !== 'undefined') {\r\n\r\n                var prm = Sys.WebForms.PageRequestManager.getInstance();\r\n\r\n                prm.add_endRequest(function () {\r\n\r\n                    $('[title]').tooltip({\r\n                        content: function () {\r\n                            return $(this).attr('title');\r\n                        }\r\n                    });\r\n\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n        <script>\r\n\r\n            function loadMapbox(callback) {\r\n\r\n                // Already loaded → just run callback\r\n                if (window.mapboxgl && window.MapboxGeocoder) {\r\n                    callback();\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                // Prevent double loading\r\n                if (window._mapboxLoading) {\r\n                    window._mapboxCallback = callback;\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                window._mapboxLoading = true;\r\n                window._mapboxCallback = callback;\r\n\r\n                // Load CSS\r\n                const css1 = document.createElement('link');\r\n                css1.rel = 'stylesheet';\r\n                css1.href = 'https://api.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/v2.7.0/mapbox-gl.css';\r\n                document.head.appendChild(css1);\r\n\r\n                const css2 = document.createElement('link');\r\n                css2.rel = 'stylesheet';\r\n                css2.href = 'https://api.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/plugins/mapbox-gl-geocoder/v5.0.0/mapbox-gl-geocoder.css';\r\n                document.head.appendChild(css2);\r\n\r\n                // Load mapbox-gl\r\n                const script1 = document.createElement('script');\r\n                script1.src = 'https://api.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/v2.7.0/mapbox-gl.js';\r\n\r\n                script1.onload = function () {\r\n                    // Load geocoder AFTER mapbox-gl\r\n                    const script2 = document.createElement('script');\r\n                    script2.src = 'https://api.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/plugins/mapbox-gl-geocoder/v5.0.0/mapbox-gl-geocoder.min.js';\r\n\r\n                    script2.onload = function () {\r\n                        window._mapboxLoading = false;\r\n                        if (window._mapboxCallback) window._mapboxCallback();\r\n                    };\r\n\r\n                    document.body.appendChild(script2);\r\n                };\r\n\r\n                document.body.appendChild(script1);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            function openLocation() {\r\n\r\n                // then load Mapbox\r\n                loadMapbox(function () {\r\n\r\n                    if (typeof mapboxgl === 'undefined' || typeof MapboxGeocoder === 'undefined') {\r\n                        return;\r\n                    }\r\n\r\n                    mapboxgl.accessToken = '[REDACTED]';\r\n\r\n                    if (window.outsavvyGeocoder) {\r\n                        $(\".mapboxgl-ctrl-geocoder--input\").val(\"London\");\r\n                        return;\r\n                    }\r\n\r\n                    window.outsavvyGeocoder = new MapboxGeocoder({\r\n                        accessToken: mapboxgl.accessToken,\r\n                        types: 'region,place,locality,neighborhood',\r\n                        placeholder: 'Events Near To...',\r\n                        countries: 'GB'\r\n                    });\r\n\r\n                    window.outsavvyGeocoder.addTo('#geocoder');\r\n\r\n                    $(\".mapboxgl-ctrl-geocoder--input\").val(\"London\");\r\n\r\n                    window.outsavvyGeocoder.on('result', function (e) {\r\n\r\n                        $(\".mapboxgl-ctrl-geocoder--input\").val(e.result.text);\r\n\r\n                        document.getElementById('HiddenLocationText').value = e.result.text;\r\n                        document.getElementById('HiddenLatLon').value = e.result.center;\r\n\r\n                        $(\"#ButtonHidden\").attr('disabled', false);\r\n                    });\r\n\r\n                    window.outsavvyGeocoder.on('clear', function () {\r\n                        document.getElementById('HiddenLocationText').value = '';\r\n                        document.getElementById('HiddenLatLon').value = '';\r\n                        $(\"#ButtonHidden\").attr('disabled', true);\r\n                    });\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n        <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Cabin:400,500,600,700|Rubik:500,700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\r\n\r\n        <!-- intersection observer polyfill -->\r\n        <script type=\"text/plain\" src=\"https://polyfill-fastly.net/v3/polyfill.min.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n            $(function () {\r\n                $('[title]').tooltip({\r\n                    content: function () {\r\n                        return $(this).attr('title');\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            });\r\n\r\n            $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n                var images = document.querySelectorAll('.lazy');\r\n\r\n                var options = {\r\n                    // If the image gets within 50px in the Y axis, start the download.\r\n                    root: null, // Page as root\r\n                    rootMargin: '100px 100px 100px 100px',\r\n                    threshold: 0\r\n                };\r\n\r\n                var fetchImage = (url) => {\r\n                    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\r\n                        var image = new Image();\r\n                        image.src = url;\r\n                        image.onload = resolve;\r\n                        image.onerror = reject;\r\n                    });\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                var loadImage = (image) => {\r\n                    var src = image.dataset.src;\r\n                    var fetch = fetchImage(src);\r\n                    fetchImage(src).then(() => {\r\n                        image.src = src;\r\n                    })\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                var handleIntersection = (entries, observer) => {\r\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\r\n                        if (entry.intersectionRatio > 0) {\r\n                            loadImage(entry.target)\r\n                        }\r\n                    })\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                // The observer for the images on the page\r\n                var observer = new IntersectionObserver(handleIntersection, options);\r\n\r\n                images.forEach(img => {\r\n                    observer.observe(img);\r\n                })\r\n\r\n                var boosts = document.querySelectorAll('.promoted');\r\n\r\n                var loadBoost = (boost) => {\r\n                    var id = boost.id.replace('boost', '');\r\n                    var source = boost.getAttribute(\"data-title\");\r\n                    sponsoredview(id, source);\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                var handleIntersection2 = (entries, observer2) => {\r\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\r\n                        if (entry.intersectionRatio > 0) {\r\n                            loadBoost(entry.target);\r\n                            observer2.unobserve(entry.target);\r\n                        }\r\n                    })\r\n                }\r\n\r\n                // The observer for the images on the page\r\n                var observer2 = new IntersectionObserver(handleIntersection2, options);\r\n\r\n                boosts.forEach(img => {\r\n                    observer2.observe(img);\r\n                })\r\n\r\n            });\r\n\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Global site tag (gtag.js) - Google Analytics -->\r\n        <script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-YYH6MCWHDF\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\r\n        <script>\r\n            window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n            function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n            gtag('js', new Date());\r\n\r\n            gtag('config', 'G-YYH6MCWHDF');\r\n\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n<script src=\"/js/validators.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script></form>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n",
