          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tWalking Sculpture Workshop  Tickets | 05 Dec @ Hackney Downs Studios (Creative Workspace), London | Pay What You Can to £10 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7769677a7968bf74e504bc7599959c8f5cdfe69ca94b0638a17c981254064d3f3540f1cb22d8839bc7820c9608d113eb98efe7ea68fbf7cc1ac3c817446e0c56/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-10-28\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A Wearable Art &amp;amp; Short Film Workshop with Estere Dzelme &amp;amp; Fred LinkUnleash your inner living artwork.  Join artists Estere Dzelme and Fred Link for a hands-on, high-energy creative workshop inspired by the pioneering Greek performance and body-artist Leda Papaconstantinou.Together, we’ll be turning the body into a canvas constructing weird, funny, camp, and sculptural costumes using a treasure trove of up-cycled materials, found objects, foil, Modroc, tactile haberdashery, and everyday scrap.Whether you want to build a towering cardboard shoulder pad, a wearable trash-chic masterpiece, or an absurd geometric suit, this workshop is all about playful self-expression, tactile experimentation, and having a laugh with custom attire.&#127909; What to ExpectPart 1: The Build (Wearable Sculptures)Dive into a rich selection of up-cycled and bio-friendly materials. Guided by Estere and Fred, you’ll draft, construct, and layer custom wearable elements directly onto the body or as outlandish costume pieces.Part 2: The Action &amp;amp; Short FilmOnce in full regalia, we’ll step out to bring our walking sculptures to life.  We will shoot a collaborative short film featuring everyone’s creations in motion, striking poses, interacting, and capturing the energy of our wearable art.Part 3: Screening &amp;amp; SocialWrap up the session, celebrate each other&#39;s creations, and get ready to see yourselves immortalised in the workshop video reel. &#127912; Key Details &amp;amp; What’s IncludedAll Materials Provided: A huge collection of upcycled textiles, plastics, wire, structural pieces, paints, tapes, and tactile materials will be ready for you to harvest.Bring Your Own (Optional): Have strange trash, old garments, odd trinkets, or weird fabrics gathering dust at home? Bring them along to incorporate. What to Wear: Wear comfortable base layers (like a tight t-shirt, leggings, or jeans) that you don&#39;t mind sticking, taping, or building around.Skill Level: All levels welcome.  No prior art, design, or costume experience needed—just bring an open mind and a willingness to play.&#128467;️ Event InfoDate &amp;amp; Time: 6.12.26 | 10AM-2PMLocation: Hackney Downs Studios\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Walking Sculpture Workshop  Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41006/walking-sculpture-workshop\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/7b82c618-00af-42b7-9256-b9cf61a96e3d.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Walking Sculpture Workshop  Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41006/walking-sculpture-workshop\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/7b82c618-00af-42b7-9256-b9cf61a96e3d.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"A Wearable Art &amp;amp; Short Film Workshop with Estere Dzelme &amp;amp; Fred LinkUnleash your inner living artwork.  Join artists Estere Dzelme and Fred Link for a hands-on, high-energy creative workshop inspired by the pioneering Greek performance and body-artist Leda Papaconstantinou.Together, we’ll be turning the body into a canvas constructing weird, funny, camp, and sculptural costumes using a treasure trove of up-cycled materials, found objects, foil, Modroc, tactile haberdashery, and everyday scrap.Whether you want to build a towering cardboard shoulder pad, a wearable trash-chic masterpiece, or an absurd geometric suit, this workshop is all about playful self-expression, tactile experimentation, and having a laugh with custom attire.&#127909; What to ExpectPart 1: The Build (Wearable Sculptures)Dive into a rich selection of up-cycled and bio-friendly materials. Guided by Estere and Fred, you’ll draft, construct, and layer custom wearable elements directly onto the body or as outlandish costume pieces.Part 2: The Action &amp;amp; Short FilmOnce in full regalia, we’ll step out to bring our walking sculptures to life.  We will shoot a collaborative short film featuring everyone’s creations in motion, striking poses, interacting, and capturing the energy of our wearable art.Part 3: Screening &amp;amp; SocialWrap up the session, celebrate each other&#39;s creations, and get ready to see yourselves immortalised in the workshop video reel. &#127912; Key Details &amp;amp; What’s IncludedAll Materials Provided: A huge collection of upcycled textiles, plastics, wire, structural pieces, paints, tapes, and tactile materials will be ready for you to harvest.Bring Your Own (Optional): Have strange trash, old garments, odd trinkets, or weird fabrics gathering dust at home? Bring them along to incorporate. What to Wear: Wear comfortable base layers (like a tight t-shirt, leggings, or jeans) that you don&#39;t mind sticking, taping, or building around.Skill Level: All levels welcome.  No prior art, design, or costume experience needed—just bring an open mind and a willingness to play.&#128467;️ Event InfoDate &amp;amp; Time: 6.12.26 | 10AM-2PMLocation: Hackney Downs Studios\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/41006/walking-sculpture-workshop\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | Walking Sculpture Workshop  | Saturday 5th December 2026 @ Hackney Downs Studios (Creative Workspace) | Pay What You Can to £10 | Find event and ticket information for Fodder\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                