ter;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Walking Sculpture Workshop </h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p>A Wearable Art &amp; Short Film Workshop with Estere Dzelme &amp; Fred Link<br>Unleash your inner living artwork! Join artists Estere Dzelme and Fred Link for a hands-on, high-energy creative workshop inspired by the pioneering Greek performance and body-artist Leda Papaconstantinou.</p><p>Together, we’ll be turning the body into a canvas constructing weird, funny, camp, and sculptural costumes using a treasure trove of up-cycled materials, found objects, foil, Modroc, tactile haberdashery, and everyday scrap.</p><p>Whether you want to build a towering cardboard shoulder pad, a wearable trash-chic masterpiece, or an absurd geometric suit, this workshop is all about playful self-expression, tactile experimentation, and having a laugh with custom attire.</p><p>🎥 What to Expect<br>Part 1: The Build (Wearable Sculptures)</p><p>Dive into a rich selection of up-cycled and bio-friendly materials. Guided by Estere and Fred, you’ll draft, construct, and layer custom wearable elements directly onto the body or as outlandish costume pieces.</p><p>Part 2: The Action &amp; Short Film</p><p>Once in full regalia, we’ll step out to bring our walking sculptures to life! We will shoot a collaborative short film featuring everyone’s creations in motion, striking poses, interacting, and capturing the energy of our wearable art.</p><p>Part 3: Screening &amp; Social</p><p>Wrap up the session, celebrate each other's creations, and get ready to see yourselves immortalised in the workshop video reel!</p><p>🎨 Key Details &amp; What’s Included<br>All Materials Provided: A huge collection of upcycled textiles, plastics, wire, structural pieces, paints, tapes, and tactile materials will be ready for you to harvest.</p><p>Bring Your Own (Optional): Have strange trash, old garments, odd trinkets, or weird fabrics gathering dust at home? Bring them along to incorporate!</p><p>What to Wear: Wear comfortable base layers (like a tight t-shirt, leggings, or jeans) that you don't mind sticking, taping, or building around.</p><p>Skill Level: All levels welcome! No prior art, design, or costume experience needed—just bring an open mind and a willingness to play.</p><p>🗓️ Event Info<br>Date &amp; Time: 6.12.26 | 10AM-2PM</p><p>Location: Hackney Downs Studios</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Hackney+Downs+Studios+(Creative+Workspace)%2c+17+Amhurst+Terrace%2c+London%2c+E8+2BT\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0675652&lat=51.55473&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Hackney+Downs+Studios+(Creative+Workspace)%2c+17+Amhurst+Terrace%2c+London%2c+E8+2BT\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 250\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0675652&lat=51.55473&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n            <p><span class=locName>Hackney Downs Studios (Creative Workspace)</span><br/>17 Amhurst Terrace, London, E8 2BT</p>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tagged\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\">\r\n  <title>location</title>\r\n  <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\r\n    <g id=\"invisible_box\" data-name=\"invisible box\">\r\n      <rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"none\"/>\r\n    </g>\r\n    <g id=\"icons_Q2\" data-name=\"icons Q2\">\r\n      <path d=\"M24,14a3,3,0,1,1-3,3,2.9,2.9,0,0,1,3-3m0-4a7,7,0,1,0,7,7,7,7,0,0,0-7-7Z\"/>\r\n      <path d=\"M24,6c7.4,0,13,6,13,14S28.4,36.7,24,41.2C19.6,36.7,11,27.5,11,20S16.6,6,24,6m0-4C14.1,2,7,10.1,7,20S18.5,41.3,22.6,45.4a1.9,1.9,0,0,0,2.8,0C29.5,41.3,41,30.1,41,20S33.9,2,24,2Z\"/>\r\n    </g>\r\n  </g>\r\n</svg><span>London Events</span></a><a href=/hashtag/art><span>Art</span></a><a href=/hashtag/workshop><span>Workshop</span></a><a href=/hashtag/screening><span>Screening</span></a><a href=/hashtag/film><span>Film</span></a>\r\n                                </span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"line-red\">The Lineup\r\n\r\n            </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"lineup\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p>fred_link @esteredzleme&nbsp;</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"line-red\">Our Vibe\r\n\r\n            </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"music-container \" id=\"music-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"music-info\">\r\n                <h4 id=\"title\">\r\n                    <label id=\"labelSongName\">The Youth by MGMT</label>\r\n                </h4>\r\n                <div class=\"progress-container\" id=\"progress-container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <audio src='https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/1d/3c/d0/1d3cd0db-a20c-744f-159f-8b5bf460a6d4/mzaf_12904187415607827881.plus.aac.p.m4a' id=\"audio\"></audio>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\r\n                <img alt=\"music-cover\" id=\"cover\" src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/favicon-96x96.png\" data-src='https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music211/v4/72/f3/ed/72f3edba-cbb0-4887-bb89-4aedf97ecd12/888880287779.jpg/110x110bb.jpg' class=\"lazy\" />\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"control-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"play\" class=\"action-button action-button-big\">\r\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#cdc2d0\" version=\"1.1\" id=\"playbutton\" width=\"30px\" height=\"30px\" viewBox=\"0 0 163.861 163.861\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n                            <g>\r\n                                <path d=\"M34.857,3.613C20.084-4.861,8.107,2.081,8.107,19.106v125.637c0,17.042,11.977,23.975,26.75,15.509L144.67,97.275   c14.778-8.477,14.778-22.211,0-30.686L34.857,3.613z\" />\r\n                            </g>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n\r\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" id=\"pausebutton\" class=\"buttonHide\" width=\"30px\" height=\"30px\" viewBox=\"-1 0 8 8\" version=\"1.1\">\r\n                            <g id=\"Page-1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\r\n                                <g id=\"Dribbble-Light-Preview\" transform=\"translate(-227.000000, -3765.000000)\" fill=\"#cdc2d0\">\r\n                                    <g id=\"icons\" transform=\"translate(56.000000, 160.000000)\">\r\n                                        <path d=\"M172,3605 C171.448,3605 171,3605.448 171,3606 L171,3612 C171,3612.552 171.448,3613 172,3613 C172.552,3613 173,3612.552 173,3612 L173,3606 C173,3605.448 172.552,3605 172,3605 M177,3606 L177,3612 C177,3612.552 176.552,3613 176,3613 C175.448,3613 175,3612.552 175,3612 L175,3606 C175,3605.448 175.448,3605 176,3605 C176.552,3605 177,3605.448 177,3606\" id=\"pause-[#1006]\">\r\n                                        </path>\r\n                                    </g>\r\n                                </g>\r\n                            </g>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"volume-container\">\r\n                    <div id=\"mute\" class=\"volume-button\">\r\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#cdc2d0\" height=\"30px\" width=\"30px\" version=\"1.1\" id=\"Filled_Icons\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" enable-background=\"new 0 0 24 24\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n                            <g id=\"Volume-Mute-Filled\">\r\n                                <path d=\"M22.29,16.21l-2.79-2.79l-2.79,2.79l-1.41-1.41L18.09,12l-2.79-2.79l1.41-1.41l2.79,2.79l2.79-2.79l1.41,1.41L20.91,12   l2.79,2.79L22.29,16.21z M1,12v4h5l6,5V3L6,8H1V12\" />\r\n                            </g>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"volume-bar\" id=\"volume-bar\">\r\n                        <div class=\"volume\" id=\"volume\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div id=\"full\" class=\"volume-button\">\r\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#cdc2d0\" height=\"30px\" width=\"30px\" version=\"1.1\" id=\"Filled_Icons\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" enable-background=\"new 0 0 24 24\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n                            <g id=\"Volume-Filled\">\r\n                                <path d=\"M15,21v-2c3.86,0,7-3.14,7-7s-3.14-7-7-7V3c4.96,0,9,4.04,9,9S19.96,21,15,21z M15,17v-2c1.65,0,3-1.35,3-3s-1.35-3-3-3V7   c2.76,0,5,2.24,5,5S17.76,17,15,17z M1,12v4h5l6,5V3L6,8H1V12\" />\r\n                            </g>\r\n                        </svg>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div id=\"need-to-know\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                        <h4 class=\"line-red\">What You Need To Know\r\n\r\n                        </h4>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Age restriction: 7+\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 44px; margin-bottom: 44px\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                <div id=\"terms\">\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                        <section>\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Terms & Conditions\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <ul class=\"event-points\">\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    Ticket Validity & Refunds  Tickets are non-refundable unless the event is officially cancelled or rescheduled by the organisers. However, you are welcome to transfer your ticket to someone else if you can no longer make it.</li>\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    Participation & Consent  By purchasing a ticket and joining the workshop, you consent to being filmed and photographed as part of the collaborative short film project. If you have any specific boundaries regarding media capture, just let us know on arrival!</li>\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    Material Safety & Clothing  We will be using various upcycled materials, tapes, glues, and crafting mediums (such as Modroc). We recommend wearing clothes you don't mind getting a little messy or adhesive on. The organisers take no responsibility for damage to personal clothing or items worn to the workshop.</li>\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    Code of Conduct  This is an inclusive, safe, and queer-friendly space for playful creative expression. Harassment, discrimination, or disrespectful behavior of any kind towards artists, staff, or fellow attendees will not be tolerated, and anyone in breach may be asked to leave.</li>\r\n            \r\n                <li>\r\n                    Accessibility & Venue Guidelines  Please check the venue's specific accessibility notes on OutSavvy. If you have any specific access or support requirements to take part in the building or filming process, please reach out to us in advance so we can accommodate you.</li>\r\n            \r\n                </ul>\r\n                            <div style=\"margin-top: 44px; margin-bottom: 44px\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n            \r\n\r\n        <section class=\"hosted-by-control\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Hosted By\r\n\r\n                </h4>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"hosted-by-control__layout\">\r\n\r\n                \r\n\r\n\r\n                <a href=\"/organiser/fodder\"\r\n                    class=\"hosted-by-control__image-link\">\r\n\r\n                    <img src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg' class=\"hosted-by-control__image lazy\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/logo/f62a88a8-13d2-4c37-85e5-c300804ecf72.jpeg\" alt=\"Fodder\" />\r\n\r\n                </a>\r\n\r\n                \r\n\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"hosted-by-control__content\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"hosted-by-control__name\">\r\n\r\n                        <a href=\"/organiser/fodder\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hosted-by-control__name-text\">Fodder</a>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <span class=\"hosted-by-control__badge\" title=\"Rising Organiser\">\r\n                            <span class=\"os-achievement-medal os-me