          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tCAMP CLASSICS presents A DIVA'S CHRISTMAS CAROL at The Divine Tickets | 22 Dec @ The Divine, London | FREE to £6 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7769677a7968bf74e504bc7599959c8f5cdfe69ca94b0638a17c981254064d3f3540f1cb22d8839bc7820c9608d113eb98efe7ea68fbf7cc1ac3c817446e0c56/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-11-01\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"CAMP CLASSICS is a queer film club. We screen films that are queer, camp, silly, retro, sometimes glazed over, or with cult followings, but mostly films that make you realise you don’t need a trillion-dollar budget and an all-star cast to make a film that has an impact.  On 22nd December, it&#39;s a CAMP CLASSICS CHRISTMAS as we celebrate A Christmas Carol if Scrooge was Willhemina Slater, at the iconic East London venue - The Divine. Vanessa Williams stars as a diva (of course) who is visited by 3 ghosts blah blah blah you know the story, but this version stars Kathy Griffin as the ghost of Christmas present. CAMP CLASSICS is a great place to meet other queers with twisted minds so come for giggles and stay for vibes. &amp;lt;3 Doors 7.30Film 8.00Duration 120 mins (w/ interval) ACCESS INFO:Unfortunately, both floors of The Divine are not currently accessible as we do nothave a lift.- The ground floor, main bar of The Divine has level access.- There is an accessible toilet in the main bar.- The cabaret and club space are in the basement of the venue. There is no lift.- There are 17 wide steps down to the basement with handrails on either side, this iswhere the show will take place.- There are two sets of gender-neutral toilets downstairs, they are not wide enoughfor wheelchairs.If you need further information, please refer to The Divine ‘About’ page on thewebsite. www.thedivine.co.uk or email us direct on info@thedivine.co.uk\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"CAMP CLASSICS presents A DIVA&#39;S CHRISTMAS CAROL at The Divine Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40810/camp-classics-presents-a-divas-christmas-carol-at-the-divine\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/2c5b3bab-6dd4-4d21-b1ed-c80e0327835c.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"CAMP CLASSICS presents A DIVA'S CHRISTMAS CAROL at The Divine Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40810/camp-classics-presents-a-divas-christmas-carol-at-the-divine\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/2c5b3bab-6dd4-4d21-b1ed-c80e0327835c.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"CAMP CLASSICS is a queer film club. We screen films that are queer, camp, silly, retro, sometimes glazed over, or with cult followings, but mostly films that make you realise you don’t need a trillion-dollar budget and an all-star cast to make a film that has an impact.  On 22nd December, it&#39;s a CAMP CLASSICS CHRISTMAS as we celebrate A Christmas Carol if Scrooge was Willhemina Slater, at the iconic East London venue - The Divine. Vanessa Williams stars as a diva (of course) who is visited by 3 ghosts blah blah blah you know the story, but this version stars Kathy Griffin as the ghost of Christmas present. CAMP CLASSICS is a great place to meet other queers with twisted minds so come for giggles and stay for vibes. &amp;lt;3 Doors 7.30Film 8.00Duration 120 mins (w/ interval) ACCESS INFO:Unfortunately, both floors of The Divine are not currently accessible as we do nothave a lift.- The ground floor, main bar of The Divine has level access.- There is an accessible toilet in the main bar.- The cabaret and club space are in the basement of the venue. There is no lift.- There are 17 wide steps down to the basement with handrails on either side, this iswhere the show will take place.- There are two sets of gender-neutral toilets downstairs, they are not wide enoughfor wheelchairs.If you need further information, please refer to The Divine ‘About’ page on thewebsite. www.thedivine.co.uk or email us direct on info@thedivine.co.uk\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/40810/camp-classics-presents-a-divas-christmas-carol-at-the-divine\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | CAMP CLASSICS presents A DIVA&#39;S CHRISTMAS CAROL at The Divine | Tuesday 22nd December 2026 @ The Divine | FREE to £6 | Find event and ticket information for CAMP CLASSICS\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function updateStickyTicketButton(hasTickets) {\n\n            var button = document.getElementById('stickyTicketButton');\n\n            if (!button) return;\n\n            if (hasTickets) {\n                button.href = '#checkout';\n            }\n            else {\n                button.href = '#anchor';\n            }\n        }\r\n\r\nfunction startConfirm(button, shouldValidate) {\r\n\r\n    // Run custom validation if this page has it\r\n    if (typeof validate === 'function' && shouldValidate) {\r\n        if (!validate()) {\r\n            return false;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // Prevent a second click\r\n    if (button.dataset.processing === 'true') {\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    button.dataset.processing = 'true';\r\n    button.classList.add('is-loading');\r\n\r\n            return true;\r\n}\r\n\r\nwindow.addEventListener('pageshow', function() {\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.loading-button').forEach(function(button) {\n        button.dataset.processing = 'false';\n        button.classList.remove('is-loading');\n    });\n\n});\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n            if (x.type === \"password\") {\r\n                x.type = \"text\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                x.type = \"password\";\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showShareModal() {\r\n            $('#shareModal').reveal({\r\n                animation: 'fadeAndPop',                   //fade, fadeAndPop, none\r\n                animationspseeed: 300,                       //how fast animtions are\r\n                closeonbackgroundclick: true,              //if you click background will modal close?\r\n                dismissmodalclass: 'close-reveal-modal'    //the class of a button or element that will close an open modal\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-57x57.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-60x60.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-72x72.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-76x76.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-114x114.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"120x120\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-120x120.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-144x144.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"152x152\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-152x152.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-180x180.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\"