                   <div class=\"bottom-gradient\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    The Festive Season!\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Drag Race UK Season 8 Viewing Party with Mocha\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-04T23:00:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38916/rpdruk-watch-with-mocha-season-8-guests\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/a0ea33ff-ee70-445f-9403-bc3a2b608907.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"New season, new viewing party.  &#128064;&#128139;&#128150;Join us every week with host and season 8 contestantMOCHAPerformances, Q&amp;amp;A, commentary, and of course the main event: the latest episode. PLUS Every week we&#39;ll be joined by another surprise Season 8 contestant.&#129296;Starting September 3rd. We&#39;ll be pressing play at 7:00 pm, so make sure you get here early to secure your spot. IT&#39;S FREE.  Bringing a group?You can reserve a table on The Rising&#39;s website.\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"The Rising\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"The Rising, 98 Harper Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"SE1 6AQ\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.49475\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0930777\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/OutOfStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38916/rpdruk-watch-with-mocha-season-8-guests\",\"lowPrice\":0,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-20T14:38:04+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-20T14:38:04+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/OutOfStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Free entry\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38916/rpdruk-watch-with-mocha-season-8-guests\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-20T14:38:04+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-20T14:38:04+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/the-rising-se1\", \"description\" : \"SE1&#39;s only queer Pub,with live events, queer quizzes and weekly drag shows.​ Open to all (dogs included), with zero judgement.We are proudly plant based and nut-free.​The Rising has been proudly serving the local community since 1936 and we&#39;re here to continue that heritage.We set out to create a queer safe space right in the heart of Elephant and Castle  to counter the loss of LGBTQ+venues.​Whether it&#39;s your 1st visit or 100th,a warm welcome awaits you at The Rising. \", \"name\" : \"The Rising SE1\"}},{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Drag Race UK Season 8 Viewing Party with Mocha\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-11T23:00:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38916/rpdruk-watch-with-mocha-season-8-guests\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/a0ea33ff-ee70-445f-9403-bc3a2b608907.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"New season, new viewing party.  &#128064;&#128139;&#128150;Join us every week with host and season 8 contestantMOCHAPerformances, Q&amp;amp;A, commentary, and of course the main event: the latest episode. PLUS Every week we&#39;ll be joined by another surprise Season 8 contestant.&#129296;Starting September 3